  "description": "Find the kth smallest element in an n x n matrix where each row and column is sorted in ascending order.",
  "target": 8,
  "pseudocode": "1. low = matrix[0][0], high = matrix[n-1][n-1]\n2. while low < high:\n3.   mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n4.   count = countLessEqual(matrix, mid)\n5.   if count < k: low = mid + 1\n6.   else: high = mid\n7. return low",
